      72.02,
      247.1,
      541.17,
      360.89
    ],
    "text": "Take Action! The Deep Depression over South Odisha moved north-northwestwards, weakened into a Depression and lay centered at 0530 a. m. today, 25th September 2026, near latitude 20.5\u00b0N and longitude 82.5\u00b0E, close to Nuapada (Odisha). Thereafter, it is very likely to continue to move north-northwestwards and weaken gradually during the subsequent 24 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      8.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      371.81,
      542.81,
      417.53
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category may increase to 70kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and the sea conditions in these areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      421.7,
      540.92,
      463.87
    ],
    "text": "The wind speed in the sea areas marked under the \u201cAdvisory\u201d category on the map below will increase to (55-65) kmph at times and those sea areas will be rough or very rough at times.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      483.07,
      542.83,
      809.38
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the sea areas bounded by 14\u00b0N to 22\u00b0N latitude and 82\u00b0E to 90\u00b0E longitude until further notice. Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move away from the affected sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
